From f888c07663637f6732168dc3eca3fc96405bccdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:35:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] test(motion): held probe of the stock-ring level for
 the HSM plan

An ignored probe, not a pin. It builds the center area of one level of
the user's D plate in the 70 x 70 stock as the 3-D ladder builds it, and
prints what the HSM plan does with each piece and with the whole level.
Held work for the effort:max follow-up.

Refs #1950

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
